golang/geo — Go implementation of the S2 geometry library    Apache-2.0
    https://github.com/golang/geo
    Copyright (c) Google Inc.

`crate::space::s2` (cell ids, caps, edge crossings, orientation predicates, and
point/edge measures) and `crate::space::r3` are ported from golang/geo's `s2`
and `r3` packages.

